Description: First-run handbook for the Amonite desktop
 Amonite Welcome is a short handbook shown after installation. It introduces
 Amonite and opens optional system capabilities (network settings, updates,
 desktop settings) when a provider is available, and leaves out the ones this
 system has no provider for. The application itself requires only GTK 4 and
 Python.
